From 9c73db4c158d4b73cd287c507503f49995054043 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emmanuel Kusiluka <emmanuelkusiluka@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 09:37:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix N+1 queries on list endpoints; add set-password links to
 emails

- RentCharge.paid_total: annotate in SQL on ledger, charges and portal
  charges list views (ledger 125 -> 3 queries, charges 203 -> 3 at ~120 tenants)
- Leases: prefetch signatures (103 -> 4 queries) and order by newest
- Houses/compounds: annotate unit/house counts instead of a COUNT per row
- House units action: select_related house + compound
- Houses searchable by compound name; tenancies searchable by resident/room
- Stable default ordering for paginated houses, compounds, assignments
- Invite and password-reset emails include a one-tap link to the
  frontend set-password page (ref + code prefilled)
- Regression test: list endpoints must use a constant number of queries

